{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_54","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\np='src/input/input.js';s=open(p).read().replace(\\\"axes=p.axes.map(x=>Math.abs(x)>.12?x:0);\\\", \\\"axes=[...p.axes];for(let pair=0;pair<2;pair++)if(Math.hypot(axes[pair*2]||0,axes[pair*2+1]||0)<.12)axes[pair*2]=axes[pair*2+1]=0;\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"this.down('d','right')?1:0\\\",\\\"(this.down('d','right')||this.pressed('d','right'))?1:0\\\").replace(\\\"this.down('a','left')?1:0\\\",\\\"(this.down('a','left')||this.pressed('a','left'))?1:0\\\").replace(\\\"this.down('s','down')?1:0\\\",\\\"(this.down('s','down')||this.pressed('s','down'))?1:0\\\").replace(\\\"this.down('w','up')?1:0\\\",\\\"(this.down('w','up')||this.pressed('w','up'))?1:0\\\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/events/training.js';s=open(p).read().replace(\\\"['poses','cairn','water'].includes(this.id)&&dist()\\\", \\\"['poses','cairn'].includes(this.id)&&dist()\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"let low=d.plates.filter(p=>p.down<=0).sort((a,b)=>a.energy-b.energy)[0],speed=low?\\\", \\\"let low=d.plates[d.botPlate];if(\"'!low||low.down>0||low.energy>=.94){low=d.plates.filter(p=>p.down<=0).sort((a,b)=>a.energy-b.energy)[0];d.botPlate=low?.index;}let speed=low?\")\ns=s.replace(\"case '\"'poses':return 100*d.gain\\\", \\\"case 'tug':return 40+30*d.wins-5*l.balancer.falls;case 'poses':return 100*d.gain\\\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/events/grand.js';s=open(p).read().replace(\\\"if(p>3&&p<3.5)l.dist.nx=3;else if(p>2&&p<3)l.target.x=-.6;\\\", \\\"if(p>3&&p<3.5)l.dist.nx=3;if(p>2&&p<3.5)l.target.x=-.6;\\\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/game/director.js';s=open(p).read().replace(\\\"finishEvent(){if(\"'!this.event)return;\", \"finishEvent(){if(!this.event)return;if(this.testBot&&window.__pads){let p=window.__pads[0];p.axes=[0,0,0,0];for(let b of p.buttons){b.value=0;b.pressed=false;}}\")\nopen(p,'\"'w').write(s)\np='src/ui/ui.js';s=open(p).read().replace(\\\"const action=b.dataset.action;this.actions[action]?.(e,b);\\\", \\\"const action=b.dataset.action;if(b.dataset.slider){if(e.detail===0)this.actions[action]?.(1,b);return;}this.actions[action]?.(e,b);\\\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='tools/test.mjs';s=open(p).read().replace(\\\"await advance(.01);check((await state()).input.leftPress\\\", \\\"await advance(1/120);check((await state()).input.leftPress\\\").replace(\\\"values.gain===.1\\\", \\\"Math.abs(values.gain-.1)<.00001\\\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\ncat >> notes/issues.md <<'EOF'\n- 03 [critical input] Quick direction taps between physics polls were lost in menus. Direction inputs now latch key presses, matching the foot/confirm path.\n- 04 [scoring] Still Water counted time in the calm zone twice, inflating form. Removed the duplicate accumulation.\n- 05 [scoring] Tug calculated the winning form before its last score assignment. Result now derives directly from pulls won.\n- 06 [gameplay] The plate bot switched target bands every tick and never replenished one. It now commits until the selected plate is healthy; pad stick deadzone is radial to preserve circles.\n- 07 [gameplay] Grand Hold's target told the player to stop bracing as the gust began. Kept the brace target through the gust.\n- 08 [input] Simulated players left the stick held on results menus. Clear the injected controller when the event ends.\n- 09 [UI] Clicking a live slider applied both the pointer position and another increment. Pointer and confirm changes now each apply once.\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs && node tools/test.mjs flow input events\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
