{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_103","type":"agent_message","text":"Fruit Hat’s main balance fault is fixed. Banking was leaving retired fruit in Rapier’s contact graph, so the “empty” hat still behaved as though it was loaded. Removing those bodies makes banking work as intended: the sharp bot banks about 28–35 fruit per round, while never banking still causes spills.\n"}}
